  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During Ge tribe’s fight with a night wolf king, Ge tribe leader’s killer move Dragon Head Drill breaks the wolf’s golden bell shield Gu and pierces its body. The heavily wounded night wolf king then turns its eyes crimson, surges with battle intent, forgets its pain, and counters with almost double its earlier battle strength. The old tribe leader names that surge as rank four brave fight Gu and calls for Chang Shan Yin.",
